**KRACK** forces nonce reuse by retransmitting **message 3** of the 4-way handshake, resetting the PTK. PoC (wpa_supplicant):
```c
// Patch wpa_supplicant to skip ACK wait
diff --git a/src/rsn_supp/wpa.c b/src/rsn_supp/wpa.c
@@ -1234, -1234,3 +1234,3 @@ void wpa_sm_step(struct wpa_sm *sm)
    if (!res) {
-       wpa_msg(sm->ctx->msg_ctx, MSG_INFO, "WPA: Retransmit 4/4");
+       wpa_msg(sm->ctx->msg_ctx, MSG_INFO, "SKIP ACK");
    }
```

**Mitigations**:
- **FilsTKIP** (Wi-Fi 6): Uses **randomized GTK** per session.
- **802.11w**: Blocks unauthenticated frames.

